{'symbol': 'JBHT', 'date': '2023-04-17 16:05:00', 'title': 'J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. REPORTS U.S. GAAP REVENUES, NET EARNINGS AND EARNINGS PER SHARE FOR THE FIRST QUARTER 2023', 'text': 'LOWELL, ARK.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. (NASDAQ: JBHT) ANNOUNCED FIRST QUARTER 2023 U.S. GAAP (UNITED STATES GENERALLY ACCEPTED ACCOUNTING PRINCIPLES) NET EARNINGS OF $197.8 MILLION, OR DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $1.89 VERSUS FIRST QUARTER 2022 NET EARNINGS OF $243.3 MILLION, OR $2.29 PER DILUTED SHARE. TOTAL OPERATING REVENUE FOR THE CURRENT QUARTER WAS $3.23 BILLION COMPARED WITH $3.49 BILLION FOR THE FIRST QUARTER 2022, A DECREASE OF 7%.'}